  "abstract": "Combine the promising Huber(\u03b4=0.01) loss with the stronger Fourier LN + learnable \u03b3[t] backbone (p=36, H=160, drop=0.05), keeping curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0. Tests whether robust loss transfers to the advanced baseline.",
